              <h1 class="TextFourXLElement FontBoldElement TrackingTightElement TextGrayNineHundredElement SmallTextFiveXLElement MediumTextSixXLElement">Thoughtful Interior Design for Everyday Living</h1>
              <p class="MarginTSixElement TextLargeElement TextGraySixHundredElement">
                Pale Stone Interiors explores how considered design can make a home feel more comfortable, coherent and personal. We bring together spatial planning, colour, materials, lighting and carefully chosen details to shape a clear direction for each interior. Every project begins with listening: understanding how a space is used, what matters to the people who live there and which practical needs should guide the design. Whether you are rethinking one room or considering a wider home
                refresh, the process is centred on useful ideas, considered choices and a calm visual language. Our aim is to help you make informed design decisions and create a home that feels distinctly yours, with a thoughtful balance between appearance and everyday function.
              </p>
              <div class="MarginTTenElement FlexElement GapXSixElement">
                <a href="#" class="RoundedLargeElement bg--600 PaddingXSixElement PaddingYFourElement TextLargeElement FontSemiBoldElement TextWhiteElement ShadowSmallElement hover:bg--500 FocusVisibleOutlineElement FocusVisibleOutlineTwoElement FocusVisibleOutlineOffsetTwoElement focus-visible:outline--600"></a>
              </div>
