              <div class="FlexGrowElement">
                <h2 class="TextGrayNineHundredElement TextLargeElement title-font FontMediumElement MarginBThreeElement">Designed Around Your Routines</h2>
                <p class="LeadingRelaxedElement TextBaseElement">
                  A useful interior begins with the way you live, rather than with a fixed style or a catalogue of trends. We consider how you move through the space, what activities happen there and which items need to be accessible. These observations can inform furniture placement, storage ideas, lighting choices and the relationship between different areas. By keeping everyday routines in view, the design can feel more natural to use while still expressing a distinctive sense of character.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
