              <div class="FlexGrowElement">
                <h2 class="TextGrayNineHundredElement TextLargeElement title-font FontMediumElement MarginBThreeElement">A Cohesive Material Palette</h2>
                <p class="LeadingRelaxedElement TextBaseElement">
                  Choosing colours and finishes can feel difficult when every decision is considered separately. A clear palette helps connect walls, surfaces, fabrics and furnishings, giving a room a more balanced overall feel. We explore how tone, texture and contrast might work together in the context of your space and preferences. The intention is not to prescribe a single look, but to help you compare options and build a considered visual direction that feels comfortable and personal.
                </p>
              </div>
