                <h2 class="TextGrayNineHundredElement TextLargeElement title-font FontMediumElement MarginBThreeElement">Practical Space Planning</h2>
                <p class="LeadingRelaxedElement TextBaseElement">
                  An interior project involves many choices, from colours and finishes to furniture placement and lighting. A collaborative process makes room for your preferences and gives each decision a clear context. We can help organise ideas into a coherent direction, explain how different elements relate and identify questions to consider before moving ahead. The purpose is to support your decision-making, keep the design conversation focused and ensure that the developing scheme reflects
                  the priorities you have shared.
                </p>
