          <div class="MarginXAutoElement MaxWidthTwoXLElement TextCenterElement">
            <h2 class="TextTwoXLElement FontBoldElement LeadingTenElement TrackingTightElement TextGrayNineHundredElement">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p class="MarginTSixElement TextBaseElement LeadingSevenElement TextGraySixHundredElement">Interior design can involve many connected decisions, and it is natural to want clarity before you begin. These answers offer a general introduction to the way Pale Stone Interiors frames design conversations. Project scope, deliverables, timing and any fees should be discussed and confirmed directly before work begins.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="MarginTTwentyElement">
            <dl class="SpaceYSixteenElement SmallGridElement SmallGridColumnsTwoElement SmallGapXSixElement SmallGapYSixteenElement SmallSpaceYZeroElement LargeGapXTenElement">
              <div>
                <dt class="TextBaseElement FontSemiBoldElement LeadingSevenElement TextGrayNineHundredElement">What can an interior design conversation cover?</dt>
                <dd class="MarginTTwoElement TextBaseElement LeadingSevenElement TextGraySixHundredElement">It can cover your priorities, how you use the space, layout possibilities, colours, materials, lighting and the overall design direction. The scope should be agreed together before any work begins.</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt class="TextBaseElement FontSemiBoldElement LeadingSevenElement TextGrayNineHundredElement">Can I ask for help with just one room?</dt>
                <dd class="MarginTTwoElement TextBaseElement LeadingSevenElement TextGraySixHundredElement">You can enquire about a single room or a wider interior. The suitable scope depends on your needs and should be discussed directly before a project is agreed.</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt class="TextBaseElement FontSemiBoldElement LeadingSevenElement TextGrayNineHundredElement">Do I need to know my preferred style already?</dt>
                <dd class="MarginTTwoElement TextBaseElement LeadingSevenElement TextGraySixHundredElement">No. You can begin by describing what you like, what is not working and how you want the space to feel. These details can help guide a discussion of possible colours, materials and layouts.</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt class="TextBaseElement FontSemiBoldElement LeadingSevenElement TextGrayNineHundredElement">How can I contact Pale Stone Interiors?</dt>
                <dd class="MarginTTwoElement TextBaseElement LeadingSevenElement TextGraySixHundredElement">Use the contact form to share a brief outline of your space and what you would like to discuss. Confirm the correct contact details and any project arrangements directly before relying on them.</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
